## Batter

Mix @flour{500 g} with @eggs{1 / 100 g @&flour}.

Crush @garlic{3 clove} with @parsley{1 tsp / 2 cloves @&garlic}.

Pour @water{500 g} and @salt{15 g / 1 L @&water}.

## Roast

Season @roast{1.2 kg} and roast ~{15 min / 500 g @&roast}.

Braise @shoulder{2 kg} ~_{1:30 h / 1 kg @&shoulder}.

Fry @cutlet{4} ~{4 min / @&cutlet}.
